---
import SkillGrid from '../SkillGrid.astro';
import RoutingFlow from './RoutingFlow.astro';
---
<section class="af-section is-intro">
  <h2>Start with the decision, not the skill name</h2>
  <p>
    Every engineering task contains decisions. Some need product clarity, some need
    architecture, a test strategy, or a code review. Invoking every skill for every
    task adds unnecessary work.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Agentflow helps coding agents choose the smallest relevant set of skills
    for the decision in front of them.</strong> If the solution is already clear,
    skip the ceremony.
  </p>
  <RoutingFlow />
</section>

<section class="af-section is-catalog">
  <h2>One router. Seven specialists.</h2>
  <p>
    The <code>agentflow</code> skill is the entry point when you need help deciding
    which engineering lens to use and running the safe implement-verify-review loop.
    Each specialist owns one distinct decision: product behavior, architecture,
    interface, implementation, verification, release, or code review.
  </p>
  <div class="af-section__catalog">
    <SkillGrid />
  </div>
  <p class="af-section__links">
    <a href="/start/choose-a-skill/">Choose a skill</a> by its engineering
    responsibility, or read the <a href="/start/quickstart/">quickstart</a> to see
    how skills compose.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="af-section is-portable">
  <h2>Portable by design</h2>
  <p>
    Agentflow is a set of versioned <code>SKILL.md</code> instructions, not a
    standalone AI model, hosted orchestration platform, or another package manager.
    Install selected skills through the <a href="/start/distribution/">skills
    ecosystem</a>, or use the <a href="/start/native-plugins/">native Claude Code
    and Codex plugins</a> where available.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Install the router and specialists together</strong> if you want the
    router to consult their full instructions. Installing the router alone does not
    install the seven specialists. Activation and invocation syntax depend on your
    coding agent.
  </p>
  <div class="af-section__actions">
    <a class="af-pill is-primary" href="/start/install/">Install Agentflow</a>
    <a class="af-pill is-secondary" href="https://github.com/howlil/agentflow" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View the source on GitHub</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .af-section {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 5.5rem 0 0;
    scroll-margin-top: 5rem;
  }

  .af-section:last-of-type {
    padding-bottom: 6.5rem;
  }

  .af-section h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--af-font-display, "Instrument Serif", Georgia, serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.4vw, 2.4rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
  }

  .af-section p {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 1.1rem 0 0;
    font: 400 0.975rem/1.75 var(--af-font-ui, inherit);
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }

  .af-section strong {
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .af-section code {
    font: 500 0.85em/1.5 var(--af-font-mono);
    color: var(--sl-color-text-accent);
    background: var(--sl-color-bg-inline-code);
    border-radius: 0.3rem;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
  }

  .af-section a:not(.af-pill) {
    color: var(--sl-color-text-accent);
    text-decoration-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-text-accent) 45%, transparent);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .af-section__catalog {
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .af-section__links {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .is-catalog .af-section__links { margin-top: 1.75rem; }

  .af-section__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 2.25rem 0 0;
  }

  .af-pill {
    min-height: 44px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0 1.25rem;
    font: 500 0.8125rem/1 var(--af-font-ui, inherit);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 160ms ease, color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease;
  }

  .af-pill.is-primary {
    background: var(--af-ivory, #F6F4EF);
    color: var(--af-ink, #0C0D10);
  }

  .af-pill.is-primary:hover {
    background: #E4DFFF;
    color: #111214;
  }

  .af-pill.is-secondary {
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
  }

  .af-pill.is-secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--sl-color-gray-4);
  }

  .af-pill:focus-visible,
  .af-section a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--af-accent, #9B8BDE);
    outline-offset: 3px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .af-pill.is-primary:focus-visible,
  .af-pill.is-secondary:focus-visible { border-radius: 999px; }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .af-section {
      width: min(100% - 28px, 1180px);
      padding-top: 4rem;
    }

    .af-section:last-of-type { padding-bottom: 4.5rem; }

    .af-section__actions { margin-top: 1.75rem; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .af-pill { transition: none; }
  }
</style>
